sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant U as 用户
    participant PE as ProjectEditScreen<br/>(进阶配置 Tab)
    participant VM as ProjectEditViewModel
    participant ED as ShellSpecEditor(纯函数)
    participant VAL as ShellSpecValidator(纯函数)
    participant MP as ShellMiniPreview
    participant HOST as ShellHost(L3 渲染器)
    participant NAV as MmaNavHost / MmaRoute
    participant PVM as ShellPreviewViewModel
    participant REPO as ProjectRepository
    participant WV as WebView 池

    %% ── 编辑：改一项壳配置 → mini 预览立刻反映 ──
    U->>PE: 在进阶配置 Tab 修改条目(标题/图标/URL)
    PE->>VM: onShellItemUpdated(area, itemId, item)
    VM->>ED: updateItem(state.shellSpec, area, itemId) { transform }
    ED-->>VM: newSpec(纯函数结果)
    VM->>VAL: validate(newSpec)
    VAL-->>VM: errors: Map<ShellField, FieldMessage>
    VM-->>PE: StateFlow<ProjectEditUiState>(shellSpec, shellErrors)
    PE->>MP: 重组(shellSpec 变化)
    MP->>HOST: ShellHost(spec, config, webViewFactory = 桩 View)
    HOST-->>MP: 壳结构重绘(顶栏/顶栏tab/底栏/抽屉)

    %% ── 顶栏 tab 选中态 ↔ pager 双向同步 ──
    U->>HOST: 点击顶栏 tab(index)
    HOST->>HOST: selectedIndex = index(立即高亮)
    HOST->>HOST: scope.launch { pagerState.animateScrollToPage(index) }
    HOST-->>U: 带动画跳页
    U->>HOST: 手动左右拖动内容区
    HOST->>HOST: visualIndex = pagerState.currentPage(指示器跟手)
    HOST->>HOST: settledPage 落定 → 回写 selectedIndex

    %% ── 保存 ──
    U->>PE: 点「保存」
    PE->>VM: save()
    VM->>VAL: validate(shellSpec)
    VAL-->>VM: errors(空则可保存)
    VM->>REPO: update(project.copy(shellSpec = ...))
    REPO-->>VM: Unit
    VM-->>PE: events: ProjectEditEvent.Saved(projectId)

    %% ── 全屏预览(带未保存草稿) ──
    U->>PE: 点「全屏预览」
    PE->>VM: 取当前草稿 shellSpec
    VM-->>PE: shellSpec
    PE->>NAV: navigate(project/{id}/run) + savedStateHandle["draft_shell_spec_json"]
    NAV->>PVM: 创建 ShellPreviewViewModel(projectId)
    PVM->>REPO: observeById(projectId)
    REPO-->>PVM: Project(含已保存 shellSpec)
    PVM-->>NAV: StateFlow<ShellPreviewUiState>(config, spec = 草稿 ?: 已保存)
    NAV->>HOST: ShellHost(spec, config, 真实 WebView)
    HOST->>WV: 单实例 / 每 tab 一个常驻实例(key = tab.id)
    WV-->>U: 壳内 Web 内容

    %% ── 离开预览：释放 WebView ──
    U->>NAV: 返回键
    NAV->>HOST: 离开组合
    HOST->>WV: DisposableEffect.onDispose → destroyAll()

    %% ── 抽屉 ──
    U->>HOST: 点顶栏抽屉按钮
    HOST->>HOST: drawerState.isOpen = true
    HOST->>WV: 内容区 onPause()（pauseContentWhileOpen）
    U->>HOST: 返回键 / 点遮罩
    HOST->>HOST: drawerState.isOpen = false
    HOST->>WV: 内容区 onResume()
